WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.634
-And finally, I know a lot of
people find math boring.

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:06.133
Well, that's why we've updated
math to make the equations

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:07.734
about stuff
that you can relate to.

00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:10.067
It's time for
"Popular Mathematics."

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.334
♪♪

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:15.367
-♪ Popular mathematics ♪

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:17.200
♪ Mathematics ♪

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.467
-Let's take a look at
our first equation here.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:22.567
If you take clogs
plus a hole punch

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:23.767
equals Crocs.

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:26.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:28.400
Popular mathematics.
-Very popular.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.501
-So, if you take Bill Clinton
plus nothing to do

00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:35.834
plus a heat wave, plus 100

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:38.133
equals the Billboard Hot 100.

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:41.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:44.934
-Wow. Bill Bored. Hot 100.

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:48.400
-If you take The Penguin...
-Right.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.000
-...plus six pints of Guinness,

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.033
it equals the Boston Celtics
mascot.

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:57.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:57.467 --> 00:00:58.567
How about this one?

00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:00.534
Here's a "kiss the chef" apron

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:02.434
plus a complaint to HR,

00:01:02.434 --> 00:01:04.868
equals "firm handshake the chef"
apron.

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:10.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.067
If you take Cheetos
plus Chachi...

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:16.534
-Uh-oh.
-...plus chicken plus euphoria

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:18.567
it equals Ch-Ch-Ch-Chia.

00:01:18.567 --> 00:01:22.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:27.734
And finally, if you take
a Twinkie plus googly eyes

00:01:27.734 --> 00:01:29.067
plus $4 billion,

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:30.968
it equals the Minions franchise.

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:32.667
There you have it.
That's all the time we have

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:34.133
for "Popular Mathematics."

